  by: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [F-2, F-3]
```

```mdl
decision D-8: A session holds tasks; threads do not have their own tasks.
  date: 2026-11-24
  by: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [F-1.2, F-2.1]
```

```mdl
decision D-9: A session exists on its own or as part of an agent.
  date: 2026-11-24
  by: user:dmaretskyi
  affects: [F-1.3, F-1.4]
```

```mdl
decision D-10: An agent is one durable object named `Agent` (formerly `AgentRouter`) plus one or more `SessionProcess`es (renamed from `AgentProcess`).
